# The Shadow Awaits (Windurst 5-2): the arms the main flow does not take. Neither key item: _6q2 the zone's default
# VESTAL_CHAMBERS_LOCKED (310), Zubaba the default 56. The Heavens Tower zone-in with ReturnCS 1, at status 3, without
# the fragment: nothing. Two wins by a GM (battlefieldWin 0; status 2 inside the event): the title only.
lists PortWindurst/onEventFinish/78 WindurstWalls/onEventFinish/93 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/111 WindurstWoods/onEventFinish/114 HeavensTower/onZoneIn/1 HeavensTower/_6q2/onTrigger HeavensTower/Zubaba/onTrigger HeavensTower/onEventFinish/214 HeavensTower/onEventFinish/215 HeavensTower/onEventFinish/216 ThroneRoom/_4l1/onTrigger ThroneRoom/_4l2/onTrigger ThroneRoom/onZoneIn/1 ThroneRoom/onEventUpdate/32000 ThroneRoom/onEventFinish/32000 ThroneRoom/onEventFinish/32001 ThroneRoom/onEventFinish/32002 ThroneRoom/onEventFinish/32003 ThroneRoom/onEventFinish/32004 ThroneRoom/onEventFinish/6 ThroneRoom/onEventFinish/7
